{"unit_id":"tag:03Q3:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n在以下各节中，我们证明关于平展上同调（<ACCENT_0001>tale cohomology）的一些基本结果。这里给出一个例子，它是拓扑空间（topological spaces）上同调（cohomology）的已知事实，对平展上同调（<ACCENT_0002>tale cohomology）也成立。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"étale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"étale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"étale cohomology","target_term":"平展上同调","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"topological spaces","target_term":"拓扑空间","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"暂译。"}],"notes":[]}
