{"unit_id":"tag:0A50:proof","translation":"注意，若<MATH_0001>为内射（injective）阿贝尔层（abelian sheaf），则<MATH_0002>正合（exact）。首项和中间项处成立，因为<MATH_0003>为层（sheaf）。右端处成立，因为<MATH_0004>满射（surjective），由《景上的上同调（Cohomology on Sites）》引理<REF_0001>。另一种证明方法是表明映射（map）<MATH_0005>的余核（cokernel）为第一<GROUPOPEN_0001><ACCENT_0001><GROUPCLOSE_0001>ech上同调（cohomology）群（group），对应于<MATH_0006>及覆盖（covering）<MATH_0007>，它由引理<REF_0002>和<REF_0003>知为零。因此，若<MATH_0008>为内射（injective）消解（resolution），则<MATH_0009>为复形（complexes）的短正合序列（short exact sequence），相应的长上同调（cohomology）正合序列（exact sequence）就是引理陈述中的序列。\n","allowed_english":["ech"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"cokernel","target_term":"余核"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"group","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射"},{"source_term":"resolution","target_term":"消解"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合序列"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"正合序列"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"内射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"abelian sheaf","target_term":"阿贝尔层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"surjective","target_term":"满射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"Cohomology on Sites","target_term":"景上的上同调","context":"章节引用。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"cokernel","target_term":"余核","context":"暂译。"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_ter